.SH "NAME"
saptune-migration \- migration of saptune version 1 to saptune version 3
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.sp
As there are too many logical and structural changes between the saptune versions 1 and 3 the migration has to be planned carefully and performed manually.
.sp
To determine the current version please run \f(CRsaptune version\fP.
.sp
ATTENTION: If the saptune version reported back is \fB2\fP or higher \fBNO\fP migration is needed!
.sp
The section \fBMIGRATION\fP will guide you through the migration process step by step. The sections \fBSOLUTIONS\fP and \fBSAP NOTES\fP will help you planning the migration.
.SH "FILES TO REMOVE AFTER MIGRATION"
.sp
The package update from version 1 to version 3 creates or copies some files during post install to allow this smooth migration. But after finishing the migration these files should be removed manually.
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.  sp -1
.  IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
\f(CR/etc/saptune/extra/SAP_BOBJ\-SAP_Business_OBJects.conf\fP
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.  sp -1
.  IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
\f(CR/etc/saptune/extra/SAP_ASE\-SAP_Adaptive_Server_Enterprise.conf\fP
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.  sp -1
.  IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
\f(CR/etc/tuned/saptune/tuned.conf\fP and the directory \f(CR/etc/tuned/saptune\fP
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.  sp -1
.  IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
\f(CR/etc/sysconfig/saptune\-note\-*\fP
.RE
.SH "IMPORTANT"
.sp
\fBOnly a migration from version 1 to version 3 is supported!\fP
